-- T4 regression test: TIMEZONE IS infers its expression with no expected
-- type, so even candidates with DIFFERENT result types (BOOLEAN vs NUMBER
-- here) tie. This must be reported as AmbiguousTermError — listing both
-- candidate types — not crash the typechecker. (The same overload shape
-- under #ASSERT is disambiguated by the expected BOOLEAN and checks cleanly.)

ASSUME foo IS A FUNCTION FROM BOOLEAN TO BOOLEAN

GIVEN p IS A BOOLEAN
DECIDE foo OF p
  IS 42

foo TRUE
